<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>A place for {{childName}} at {{clubName}}</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      background-color: #f4f4f4;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }
    .container {
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 20px auto;
      background: #fff;
      border-radius: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    .header {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8B5CF6 0%, #7C3AED 100%);
      color: #fff;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .content {
      padding: 30px 20px;
    }
    .details {
      background: #F5F3FF;
      border-left: 4px solid #8B5CF6;
      padding: 20px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .details h3 {
      margin: 0 0 10px 0;
      color: #6D28D9;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .details table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
    }
    .details td {
      padding: 6px 0;
      vertical-align: top;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .details td.label {
      color: #6B7280;
      width: 40%;
    }
    .deadline {
      background: #FEF3C7;
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 15px;
      margin: 20px 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .deadline p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #92400E;
      font-weight: 600;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      background: #8B5CF6;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 14px 28px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-weight: 600;
      margin: 10px 0;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 16px;
    }
    .secondary-link {
      display: inline-block;
      color: #6B7280;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }
    .footer {
      background: #F8FAFC;
      padding: 20px;
      text-align: center;
      color: #64748B;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
    .footer p {
      margin: 5px 0;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <h1>A place has come up</h1>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
      <p>Dear {{parentName}},</p>

      <p>A place has come up for {{childName}} at {{clubName}}, and {{childName}} is next on our waiting list for it.</p>

      <div class="details">
        <h3>The place</h3>
        <table>
          <tr>
            <td class="label">Class or squad</td>
            <td>{{squadName}}</td>
          </tr>
{{#if trainingTimes}}
          <tr>
            <td class="label">Training times</td>
            <td>{{trainingTimes}}</td>
          </tr>
{{/if}}
{{#if coachName}}
          <tr>
            <td class="label">Coach</td>
            <td>{{coachName}}</td>
          </tr>
{{/if}}
        </table>
      </div>

      <div class="deadline">
        <p>Please reply by {{expiresOn}}</p>
      </div>

      <p>We hold the place for you until then. If we have not heard from you by that date it passes to the next family on the list, and {{childName}} stays on the waiting list for other classes. Get in touch if you would like us to look at this one again.</p>

      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <a href="{{acceptUrl}}" class="button">Accept the place</a>
        <br>
        <a href="{{declineUrl}}" class="secondary-link">No thank you, not this time</a>
      </div>

      <p>Accepting sets everything up in one step: {{memberNounLower}} record, register place, consent forms and the Direct Debit for fees. We will email you what to do next.</p>

      <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
        Best wishes,<br>
        <strong>{{clubName}}</strong>
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <p>&copy; {{year}} {{clubName}}. All rights reserved.</p>
      <p>This is an automated email. Please do not reply to this message.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
